    "detailed_description": "20 popular Klondike games in one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you love Klondike (also known as &quot;Classic Solitaire&quot; or &quot;Patience&quot;), but want a bigger challenge?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow you can play Klondike and other popular variants with different levels of difficulty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe collection contains:<br />\r\n\u2022 Agnes Bernauer<br />\r\n\u2022 Batsford<br />\r\n\u2022 Blind Alleys<br />\r\n\u2022 Giant<br />\r\n\u2022 King Albert<br />\r\n\u2022 Klondike<br />\r\n\u2022 New York<br />\r\n\u2022 Pas Seul<br />\r\n\u2022 Thumb and Pouch<br />\r\n\u2022 Westcliff<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlus 10 more...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2022 Unlimited undo<br />\r\n\u2022 Auto complete<br />\r\n\u2022 Statistics<br />\r\n\u2022 Rules for each game",
